    "name": "Cantaloupe Chronicle",
    "steam_appid": 3176050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Cantaloupe Chronicle</i>, you step into the shoes of a budding journalist on your first day as an intern at the town\u2019s quirky newspaper, <i>The Cantaloupe Chronicle</i>. Set in a cozy roadside town filled with intrigue, this game invites players to explore a rich, atmospheric environment. Interact with eccentric locals, solve puzzles, and uncover stories that will shape your career as a reporter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story centers on an old mystery, but the theme explores how not every story ends cleanly and how we learn to live without closure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic point-and-click gameplay</strong> with a modern touch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative article-writing system</strong> that transforms clues into publishable stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy, atmospheric setting</strong> full of secrets and offbeat characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted puzzles</strong> designed to reward exploration and curiosity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Context sensitive hint system</strong> to prevent you from getting stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Around 4-8</strong> <strong>hours</strong> of playtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176050/extras/4c86df593e6c00ffe01c01a1d0bc1bb5.avif?t=1752918705\" width=600 height=620 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Glimpse into </strong><i>Cantaloupe Chronicle</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players arrive in the cozy town of Cantaloupe to start their internship at their aunt's newspaper. What begins as a simple learning experience quickly turns into a quest to uncover the secrets of the town's past\u2014including the mysterious case of a body found years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players collect items, talk to the townsfolk, and solve engaging puzzles, they\u2019ll craft articles using an innovative text editor system. Writing doesn\u2019t feel daunting here\u2014players unlock text blocks from their investigations and insert them into articles with ease. From small-town gossip to the big front-page story, every article brings them closer to the ultimate truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cantaloupe Chronicle</i> is developed by a single developer, me \u2013 Tim Rachor. I have been working as a professional Game Designer for over 15 years in the industry and some years ago I decided that I wanted to create my own games in my spare time. This is the third point-and-click adventure I'll release and my 12th game on Steam overall.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Cantaloupe Chronicle</i>, you step into the shoes of a budding journalist on your first day as an intern at the town\u2019s quirky newspaper, <i>The Cantaloupe Chronicle</i>. Set in a cozy roadside town filled with intrigue, this game invites players to explore a rich, atmospheric environment. Interact with eccentric locals, solve puzzles, and uncover stories that will shape your career as a reporter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story centers on an old mystery, but the theme explores how not every story ends cleanly and how we learn to live without closure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic point-and-click gameplay</strong> with a modern touch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative article-writing system</strong> that transforms clues into publishable stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy, atmospheric setting</strong> full of secrets and offbeat characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted puzzles</strong> designed to reward exploration and curiosity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Context sensitive hint system</strong> to prevent you from getting stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Around 4-8</strong> <strong>hours</strong> of playtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176050/extras/4c86df593e6c00ffe01c01a1d0bc1bb5.avif?t=1752918705\" width=600 height=620 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Glimpse into </strong><i>Cantaloupe Chronicle</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players arrive in the cozy town of Cantaloupe to start their internship at their aunt's newspaper. What begins as a simple learning experience quickly turns into a quest to uncover the secrets of the town's past\u2014including the mysterious case of a body found years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As players collect items, talk to the townsfolk, and solve engaging puzzles, they\u2019ll craft articles using an innovative text editor system. Writing doesn\u2019t feel daunting here\u2014players unlock text blocks from their investigations and insert them into articles with ease. From small-town gossip to the big front-page story, every article brings them closer to the ultimate truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cantaloupe Chronicle</i> is developed by a single developer, me \u2013 Tim Rachor. I have been working as a professional Game Designer for over 15 years in the industry and some years ago I decided that I wanted to create my own games in my spare time. This is the third point-and-click adventure I'll release and my 12th game on Steam overall.</p>",
    "short_description": "Today marks the beginning of your internship at the Cantaloupe Chronicle! Step into the shoes of a young reporter in a classic Point &amp; Click Adventure as you uncover the mysteries of the small town. Write compelling articles, snap intriguing photos, and talk to the quirky townsfolk.",
